# Railway's Root Directory for the backend service is set to `backend`,
# but Railway still uploads the whole repo checkout as build context
# before cd-ing in, and its dependency-vulnerability scan reads every
# lockfile it finds in that context. Without this, the root Next.js
# package-lock.json gets flagged even though the backend never depends
# on it. Exclude everything except the backend service.
*
!backend
!backend/**
